window.Handbook.register({"id":"ch220","pages":[{"n":1632,"html":"<p class=\"caption\">图219.36<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">如果发送成功在USB 转CAN 的上位机软件中会显示接收到数据，如图219.37 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图219.37\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1632-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图219.37\" width=\"974\" height=\"253\"><\/button><figcaption>图219.37 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1283\"><\/span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第220 章CAN 应用编程<\/h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章节中将会讲解控制CAN 接口的第二种方式，通过C 应用程序来控制CAN 接口。因为CAN 设备在Linux 中被归类为网络设备，所以也是使用socket 控制CAN。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1284\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">220.1 创建套接字<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">socket()是网络通信的基础函数，用于创建套接字（socket），相当于网络通信的“端口”。函数原型：int socket(int domain, int type, int protocol);<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">返回值：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回一个非负整数（套接字描述符），后续的网络操作都需要使用这个描述符。失败返回-1。函数参数：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）domain：协议族<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">常用的协议族如图220.1 所示：<\/p>"},{"n":1633,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.1\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1633-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.1\" width=\"975\" height=\"436\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.1 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（2）type：套接字类型<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">常用的类型如图220.2 所示：<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.2\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1633-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.2\" width=\"974\" height=\"170\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.2 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（3）protocol：协议类型<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">指定具体的协议，通常设置为0，表示根据domain 和type 自动选择合适的协议。常的协议如图220.3 所示：<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.3\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1633-fig03.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.3\" width=\"973\" height=\"214\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.3 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">创建CAN 套接字示例代码如代码清单220.1 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单220.1<\/p>"},{"n":1634,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"26\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;sys/socket.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/can.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/can/raw.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">int main() {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int sockfd;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //创建CAN 套接字，PF_CAN 表示使用CAN 协议族，SOCK_RAW 表示使用原始套接字，CAN_RAW 表<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">示使用原始CAN 协议<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    sockfd = socket(PF_CAN, SOCK_RAW, CAN_RAW);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (sockfd == -1) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        perror(&quot;Socket creation failed&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return EXIT_FAILURE;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    printf(&quot;CAN socket created successfully\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //关闭套接字（可选）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    close(sockfd);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1634 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1634\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1285\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">220.2 绑定网络接口<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">使用bind()函数将创建的套接字与物理CAN 接口进行绑定，以便参与CAN 网络的通信。函数原型：int bind(int sockfd, const struct sockaddr *addr, socklen_t addrlen);<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">返回值：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">成功时返回0，表示绑定成功。失败时，返回-1。函数参数：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（1）sockfd:通过socket()函数创建的套接字描述符，指定要绑定的套接字。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（2）addr:指向sockaddr 结构体的指针，存储要绑定的地址信息（实际使用时通常使用struct sockaddr_in 或struct sockaddr_in6 等具体类型，再强制转换为struct sockaddr *类型）。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">（3）addrlen :addr 结构体的大小，通常用sizeof()获取对应地址结构体的长度。<\/p>"},{"n":1635,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">然后在上一小节编写的创建CAN 套接字代码的基础上加上bind()绑定相关的内容，具体如代码清单220.2 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单220.2<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"39\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;string.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;sys/socket.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;sys/ioctl.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;net/if.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/can.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/can/raw.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">int main(int argc, char *argv[]) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int sockfd; //套接字描述符<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct sockaddr_can addr; // CAN 地址结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct ifreq ifr; //用于获取网络接口信息<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //创建CAN 套接字<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    sockfd = socket(PF_CAN, SOCK_RAW, CAN_RAW);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (sockfd &lt; 0) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printf(&quot;Socket creation failed&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //指定要绑定的CAN 接口名称，以can0 为例<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    strncpy(ifr.ifr_name, &quot;can0&quot;, IFNAMSIZ - 1);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //使用ioctl 获取CAN 接口的索引号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ioctl(sockfd, SIOCGIFINDEX, &amp;ifr)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //设置CAN 地址结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    addr.can_family = AF_CAN; //CAN 地址族<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    addr.can_ifindex = ifr.ifr_ifindex; //CAN 接口索引号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //绑定套接字到指定的CAN 接口<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    bind(sockfd, (struct sockaddr *)&amp;addr, sizeof(addr))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //关闭套接字（实际应用中可以继续发送/接收数据）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    close(s);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1635 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1635\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1636,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"40\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1636 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1636\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第27 行，使用ioctl 系统调用通过SIOCGIFINDEX 宏获取CAN 接口的索引号，除了SIOCGIFINDEX 宏之外，在网络设备中还有其他功能的宏，具体如图220.4 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.4\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1636-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.4\" width=\"975\" height=\"499\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.4 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1286\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">220.3 发送数据<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在CAN总线通信中，数据不能直接发送，必须先进行封包操作。Linux中使用struct can_frame结构体来封装CAN 数据帧，该结构体定义在&lt;linux/can.h&gt;头文件中，结构体内容如代码清单220.3 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单220.3<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"5\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct can_frame {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    canid_t can_id;  // CAN 标识符（ID）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    __u8    can_dlc; //数据长度码（0 到8 字节）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    __u8    data[8]; //数据内容，最多8 字节<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1636 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1636\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">如代码清单220.4 所示展示了如何定义并填充3 个不同类型的CAN 帧：标准帧、扩展帧和远程帧。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单220.4<\/p>"},{"n":1637,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"13\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct can_frame frame[3];        //定义3 个CAN 帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">unsigned char data[2] = {0x01, 0x02}; //要发送的数据内容<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">frame[0].can_id = 0x11;        //标准帧ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">frame[0].can_dlc = 2;        //数据长度为2 字节<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">memcpy(frame[0].data, data, 2); //填充数据内容<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">frame[1].can_id = 0x11 | CAN_EFF_FLAG; //扩展帧ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">frame[1].can_dlc = 2;        //数据长度为2 字节<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">memcpy(frame[1].data, data, 2);       //填充数据内容<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">frame[2].can_id = 0x11 | CAN_RTR_FLAG; //远程帧ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">frame[2].can_dlc = 2;        //数据长度为2 字节<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1637 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1637\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">因此编写发送CAN 数据应用程序通常包括以下三个步骤：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">步骤一：使用socket()函数创建CAN 原始套接字。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">步骤二：通过bind()函数将套接字与物理CAN 接口绑定。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">步骤三：定义CAN 帧数组并初始化CAN 帧，使用write()函数将CAN 帧发送至总线。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">CAN 数据发送应用代码can_send.c 如代码清单220.5 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本实验代码存放在网盘iTOP-RK3568 开发板\\07_学习教程配套资料\\03_Linux 驱动配套资料\\04_Linux 驱动程序\\130_can\\02_send 路径下。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单220.5<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"19\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;fcntl.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;string.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;sys/socket.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;sys/ioctl.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;net/if.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/can.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/can/raw.h&gt; //包含CAN_RAW 相关定义<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">int main(int argc, char *argv[]) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int sockfd; //套接字描述符<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct sockaddr_can addr; //CAN 地址结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct ifreq ifr; //用于获取网络接口信息<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int ret; //用于存储系统调用返回值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //创建CAN 套接字<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    sockfd = socket(PF_CAN, SOCK_RAW, CAN_RAW);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (sockfd &lt; 0) {<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1637 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1637\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1638,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"20\" data-end=\"63\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printf(&quot;Socket creation failed&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //指定要绑定的CAN 接口名称，以can0 为例<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    strncpy(ifr.ifr_name, &quot;can0&quot;, IFNAMSIZ - 1);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //使用ioctl 获取CAN 接口的索引号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ioctl(sockfd, SIOCGIFINDEX, &amp;ifr) &lt; 0) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printf(&quot;ioctl failed&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        close(sockfd);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //设置CAN 地址结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    addr.can_family = AF_CAN; //CAN 地址族<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    addr.can_ifindex = ifr.ifr_ifindex; //CAN 接口索引号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //绑定套接字到指定的CAN 接口<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (bind(sockfd, (struct sockaddr *)&amp;addr, sizeof(addr)) &lt; 0) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printf(&quot;Bind failed&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        close(sockfd);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //定义CAN 帧数组<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct can_frame frame[3]; //CAN 帧数组<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned char data[2] = {0x01, 0x02}; //数据内容<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //初始化标准帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    frame[0].can_id = 0x11; //标准帧ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    frame[0].can_dlc = 2;   //数据长度（2 字节）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    memcpy(frame[0].data, data, 2); //填充数据<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //初始化扩展帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    frame[1].can_id = 0x11 | CAN_EFF_FLAG; //扩展帧ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    frame[1].can_dlc = 2;        //数据长度（2 字节）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    memcpy(frame[1].data, data, 2);       //填充数据<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //初始化远程帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    frame[2].can_id = 0x11 | CAN_RTR_FLAG; //远程帧ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    frame[2].can_dlc = 2;        //数据长度（2 字节）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //循环发送CAN 帧<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1638 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1638\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1639,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"97\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    while (1) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //发送标准帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = write(sockfd, &amp;frame[0], sizeof(frame[0]));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (ret != sizeof(frame[0])) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            printf(&quot;write (标准帧)&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            break;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printf(&quot;标准帧发送成功！\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //发送扩展帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = write(sockfd, &amp;frame[1], sizeof(frame[1]));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (ret != sizeof(frame[1])) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            printf(&quot;write (扩展帧)&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            break;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printf(&quot;扩展帧发送成功！\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //发送远程帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = write(sockfd, &amp;frame[2], sizeof(frame[2]));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (ret != sizeof(frame[2])) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">84<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            printf(&quot;write (远程帧)&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">85<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            break;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">86<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">87<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        printf(&quot;远程帧发送成功！\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">88<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">89<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //延时1 秒<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">90<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        sleep(1);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">91<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">92<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">93<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //关闭套接字<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">94<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    close(sockfd);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">95<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">96<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">97<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1639 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1639\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">使用aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc can_send.c -o can_send 命令交叉应用程序，如图220.5 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.5\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1639-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.5\" width=\"974\" height=\"80\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.5 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后将编译完成的可执行程序拷贝到开发板上，拷贝完成如图220.6 所示。<\/p>"},{"n":1640,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.6\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1640-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.6\" width=\"972\" height=\"155\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.6 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后使用以下命令设置CAN 接口波特率并启动。ip link set can0 type can bitrate 250000 ifconfig can0 up如图220.7 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.7\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1640-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.7\" width=\"972\" height=\"68\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.7 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后使用./can_send 运行程序向USB 转CAN 设备发送数据，运行之后如图220.8 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.8\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1640-fig03.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.8\" width=\"972\" height=\"152\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.8 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">如果数据发送成功在USB 转CAN 的上位机中会打印接收到的数据，如图220.9 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.9\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1640-fig04.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.9\" width=\"973\" height=\"300\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.9 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此，关于发送数据的应用程序就测试完成了。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1287\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">220.4 接收数据<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">编写接收CAN 数据应用程序包括以下三个主要步骤：<\/p>"},{"n":1641,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">步骤一：使用socket()函数创建CAN 原始套接字。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">步骤二：通过bind()函数将套接字与物理CAN 接口绑定。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">步骤三：通过read()函数监听总线数据，并解析帧类型与内容。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">CAN 数据接收应用代码can_recv.c 如代码清单220.6 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本实验代码存放在网盘iTOP-RK3568 开发板\\07_学习教程配套资料\\03_Linux 驱动配套资料\\04_Linux 驱动程序\\130_can\\03_recv 路径下。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单220.6<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"33\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;string.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;unistd.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;net/if.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;sys/ioctl.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;sys/socket.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/can.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#include &lt;linux/can/raw.h&gt;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#define BUF_SIZE 128 //缓冲区大小<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">int main() {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int sockfd; //套接字文件描述符<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct sockaddr_can addr; //CAN 地址结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct ifreq ifr; //网络接口请求结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct can_frame frame; //CAN 帧结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    char buf[BUF_SIZE]; //格式化输出缓冲区<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int ret, n, i, err;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    FILE *out = stdout; //输出文件流（标准输出）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //创建CAN 套接字<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    sockfd = socket(PF_CAN, SOCK_RAW, CAN_RAW);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //指定CAN 接口名称<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    strcpy(ifr.ifr_name, &quot;can0&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ioctl(sockfd, SIOCGIFINDEX, &amp;ifr);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //设置地址信息<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    addr.can_family = AF_CAN;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    addr.can_ifindex = ifr.ifr_ifindex;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //绑定CAN 接口<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1641 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1641\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1642,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"77\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    bind(sockfd, (struct sockaddr *)&amp;addr, sizeof(addr));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //循环接收CAN 帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    while (1) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //接收CAN 帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = read(sockfd, &amp;frame, sizeof(frame));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (ret &lt;= 0) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            printf(&quot;read&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            break;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //格式化输出CAN 帧信息<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (frame.can_id &amp; CAN_EFF_FLAG) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            //扩展帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            n = snprintf(buf, BUF_SIZE, &quot;&lt;0x%08x&gt;&quot;, frame.can_id &amp; CAN_EFF_MASK);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        } else {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            //标准帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            n = snprintf(buf, BUF_SIZE, &quot;&lt;0x%03x&gt;&quot;, frame.can_id &amp; CAN_SFF_MASK);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //添加数据长度<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        n += snprintf(buf + n, BUF_SIZE - n, &quot;[%d]&quot;, frame.can_dlc);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //添加数据内容<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        for (i = 0; i &lt; frame.can_dlc; i++) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            n += snprintf(buf + n, BUF_SIZE - n, &quot; %02x&quot;, frame.data[i]);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果是远程帧<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (frame.can_id &amp; CAN_RTR_FLAG) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            n += snprintf(buf + n, BUF_SIZE - n, &quot; remote request&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //输出到标准输出<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        fprintf(out, &quot;%s\\n&quot;, buf);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //刷新输出缓冲区<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        err = fflush(out);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (err &lt; 0) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            perror(&quot;fflush&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            break;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1642 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1642\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1643,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"81\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //关闭套接字<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    close(sockfd);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1643 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1643\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">使用aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc -o can_recv can_recv.c 命令交叉应用程序，如图220.10 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.10\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1643-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.10\" width=\"974\" height=\"77\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.10 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后将编译完成的可执行程序拷贝到开发板上，拷贝完成如图220.11 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.11\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1643-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.11\" width=\"974\" height=\"68\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.11 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后使用以下命令设置CAN 接口波特率并启动。ip link set can0 type can bitrate 250000 ifconfig can0 up<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">如图220.12 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.12\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1643-fig03.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.12\" width=\"972\" height=\"68\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.12 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后使用./can_recv 运行程序等待数据的发送，运行之后如图220.13 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.13\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1643-fig04.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.13\" width=\"974\" height=\"73\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.13 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后使用USB 转CAN 设备分别向iTOP-RK3568 开发板发送标准数据帧、标准遥控帧、扩展数据帧还有扩展遥控帧，发送完成如图220.14 所示。<\/p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.14\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1643-fig05.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.14\" width=\"973\" height=\"212\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.14 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">如果开发板上成功接收到数据会打印对应的帧，如图220.15 所示。<\/p>"},{"n":1644,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图220.15\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1644-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图220.15\" width=\"975\" height=\"114\"><\/button><figcaption>图220.15 · 点击放大<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此，关于接收CAN 帧的应用程序就测试完成了。<\/p>"},{"n":1645,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1288\"><\/span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第221 章过滤规则的设置<\/h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在前文中，我们分别介绍了通过CAN 工具和应用程序收发CAN 帧的方法。实际应用中，通常需对接收的数据进行过滤处理，例如仅接收ID 为0x123 的帧。本章将详细讲解如何在工具及应用程序中设置CAN 过滤规则。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1289\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">221.1 使用can 工具设置过滤规则<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在Linux 中，可通过candump 工具设置过滤规则。语法支持两种形式：·匹配规则：&lt;can id&gt;:&lt;can mask&gt;·排除规则：&lt;can id&gt;~&lt;can mask&gt;<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">含义分别如下：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">&lt;can_id&gt;:&lt;can_mask&gt;：表示当接收到的CAN ID 满足条件&lt;received can_id&gt; &amp;mask == can_id &amp;mask 时匹配。其中，mask 决定了哪些位需要参与匹配，只有对应位为1 的部分才会被检查，而can_id 则是期望匹配的目标ID。这种规则通常用于筛选符合特定ID 和格式的帧，例如只接收某个标准帧或扩展帧。&lt;can_id&gt;~&lt;can_mask&gt;：则与第一种相反，表示当接收到的CAN ID 满足条件&lt;received can_id&gt;&amp; mask != can_id &amp; mask 时匹配。它的作用是排除特定ID 的帧，即忽略满足条件的帧，而接收其他所有帧。这种规则适用于需要过滤掉某些特定帧的场景，例如屏蔽某个干扰源或排除不需<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">要的远程帧。1.扩展知识标准帧与扩展帧的区分：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">标准帧的CAN ID 长度为11 位，帧ID 范围是0x000 到0x7FF。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">扩展帧的CAN ID 长度为29 位，帧ID 范围是0x00000000 到0x1FFFFFFF。CAN ID 特殊标志位说明：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">CAN ID 实际是一个32 位的值，在内核源码include/uapi/linux/can.h 头文件中，还有以下特殊标志位用于识别帧类型（对应的宏定义中不包含11 位或29 位ID，只有帧类型），如图221.1所示：<\/p>"}]});
